  "//geometry": [
    "The level is carved out of solid rock, Doom-style: brush 0 fills the whole",
    "3x3-chunk volume with stone and brush 1 lays bedrock under it, so no CLEAR",
    "can ever leak into a void. Every room below is a CLEAR carving out of that",
    "mass; floors are repainted afterwards so each space reads differently.",
    "",
    "  R1 start hangar   x  5..27  z  5..27   floor y7   ceiling y18",
    "  C1 dark corridor  x 15..17  z 28..44   floor y7   ceiling y13",
    "  R2 hangar floor   x  5..43  z 45..75   floor y7   ceiling y21   (blue key)",
    "  D1 BLUE DOOR      x 44      z 56..58   y 8..11",
    "  C2 airlock        x 45..55  z 56..58   floor y7   ceiling y13",
    "  R3 east wing      x 57..87  z 45..75   floor y7   ceiling y21   (exit)",
    "  C3 return duct    x 71..73  z 25..44   floor y7   ceiling y13",
    "  R4 catwalk hall   x 29..73  z 17..24   floor y7, stairs up to y13 at the west end",
    "  W1 one-way window x 28      z 19..21   y 14..16  -> 6-block drop into R1",
    "  S1 secret alcove  x  1.. 3  z 13..17   behind a fake wall in R1",
    "",
    "The loop only runs one way. You cannot climb from R1 into R4, so the exit in",
    "R3 is behind the blue door and nothing else; the catwalk is the shortcut home."
  ],

